WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:11.769
The mean is the total shared equally: add the values and divide by how many there

00:00:11.769 --> 00:00:12.130
are.

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:22.622
The median is the middle value after sorting the numbers. The mode is the value that

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.362
appears most often.

00:00:27.162 --> 00:00:33.642
The range shows the spread: subtract the smallest value from the largest.
